# ACOVON — COMPLETE AI-POWERED PERSONALIZED CONTENT RECOMMENDATION, DISCOVERY & SMART FEED ENGINE

## PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Build a sophisticated, continuously learning recommendation algorithm for ACOVON.

The system should provide a personalized content experience inspired by the recommendation systems used by TikTok, Instagram, Facebook and YouTube.

The goal is to understand each fan's interests and automatically recommend videos, photos, creators, posts, livestreams and other eligible content they are most likely to enjoy.

Every fan must have an individual recommendation profile.

The platform must continuously learn from fan engagement and improve recommendations over time.

**The more a fan uses ACOVON, the better the platform should understand their interests and personalize their content experience.**

Do not create a static feed that displays the same content to everyone.

Do not rebuild the existing Feed, Explore, search, creator discovery or video playback systems. Extend the existing application and reuse its current infrastructure.

