# 2. PERSONALIZED FOR YOU RECOMMENDATION ENGINE

Build an intelligent recommendation engine that learns what each fan enjoys.

The For You filter must produce an individual feed for every fan.

Examples:

- If a fan frequently watches fitness videos, recommend more relevant fitness content.
- If a fan repeatedly watches content from particular creators, recommend more content from those creators.
- If a fan frequently watches cooking videos, recommend relevant cooking content and creators.
- If a fan enjoys photography, recommend photography content and similar creators.
- If a fan frequently saves particular content, learn from those saves.
- If a fan repeatedly skips a category, gradually reduce its recommendation priority.
- If a fan develops a new interest, adapt the feed accordingly.

The algorithm must recognize changing interests instead of permanently assuming that a fan likes the same content.

Do not show identical recommendations to all fans.

