- Followers-only content.
- Subscriber-only content.
- PPV content.
- Private content when the fan is authorized.

However, recommendations must never bypass access restrictions.

Before showing full media, previews, playback URLs or purchase options, enforce the relevant access policy.

For paid content:
- Show only previews permitted by creator settings.
